# Hotshot Logistics configuration
# Do not copy this file to .env. Store secrets with .NET user secrets or a secret store.

# Local development (API, tests, and MigrationRunner share this UserSecretsId):
#   dotnet user-secrets set "ConnectionStrings:DefaultConnection" "<connection-string>" --project 1-Presentation/HotshotLogistics.Api/HotshotLogistics.Api.csproj
#
# Optional Azure App Configuration (skipped when unset; user secrets remain the source):
#   dotnet user-secrets set "AppConfiguration:Endpoint" "https://<store-name>.azconfig.io" --project 1-Presentation/HotshotLogistics.Api/HotshotLogistics.Api.csproj
#   # or ConnectionStrings:AppConfig
#
# CI / process environment override:
#   CONNECTIONSTRINGS__DEFAULTCONNECTION
#
# Docker Compose still reads SQL_SA_PASSWORD from the process environment (not this repo).
